WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.055
Theo has joined AMG and wants to start selling health plans.

00:00:05.055 --> 00:00:11.028
Maryland requires a producer license before a person sells, solicits or negotiates insurance.

00:00:11.028 --> 00:00:17.461
Selling means exchanging a contract for money; soliciting means urging someone to apply; negotiating

00:00:17.461 --> 00:00:23.894
means discussing the terms of a contract with a buyer on an insurer’s behalf.

00:00:23.894 --> 00:00:28.489
The license names the lines of authority the holder may

00:00:28.489 --> 00:00:33.084
handle, such as life, health, property or casualty; for this

00:00:33.084 --> 00:00:37.679
course, the health line is accident and health or sickness.

00:00:37.679 --> 00:00:42.274
Licensing exists to set qualifications, create accountability to the Insurance

00:00:42.274 --> 00:00:46.410
Administration and give consumers a regulator to turn to.

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:51.417
A resident applicant must be at least eighteen, have the character and trustworthiness

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:56.424
the law requires, pass the Prometric examination for the line sought, file a

00:00:56.424 --> 00:01:01.046
complete and truthful application and pay the license fee, currently 54 dollars.

00:01:01.046 --> 00:01:06.053
Maryland repealed its mandatory prelicensing education requirement effective October 1, 2024, so a

00:01:06.053 --> 00:01:11.060
course is no longer required, though the exam and later continuing education remain.

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:16.452
An applicant who fails must wait at least four days before retaking the exam.

00:01:16.452 --> 00:01:21.073
False statements on the application are themselves grounds for denial or later

00:01:21.073 --> 00:01:25.310
revocation, so the application is a legal document, not a formality.

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:29.261
An insurance producer sells, solicits or negotiates for an insurer.

00:01:29.261 --> 00:01:34.398
An insurance adviser is paid a fee to examine policies and give advice,

00:01:34.398 --> 00:01:39.535
and Maryland requires a separate adviser license for that work; a licensed producer

00:01:39.535 --> 00:01:44.672
acting as a producer for a client is exempt from the adviser rules,

00:01:44.672 --> 00:01:49.414
so Theo may explain the plans he sells without a second license.

00:01:49.414 --> 00:01:53.760
A nonresident producer holds a resident license in good standing in

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:58.107
a home state and obtains a Maryland nonresident license through reciprocity,

00:01:58.107 --> 00:02:02.058
with the application and fee but usually no Maryland exam.

00:02:02.058 --> 00:02:06.800
The home-state license is not permission to work in Maryland by itself.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:08.965
AMG itself is a business entity.

00:02:08.965 --> 00:02:14.018
An agency or other business that sells, solicits or negotiates must hold its own

00:02:14.018 --> 00:02:19.071
license and must designate a licensed producer as its principal contact with the Administration.

00:02:19.071 --> 00:02:23.402
That designated producer keeps the entity’s information current and responds to investigations.

00:02:23.402 --> 00:02:28.455
The entity’s license never covers an individual’s personal selling; every person who sells for

00:02:28.455 --> 00:02:33.507
AMG needs an individual license, and calling salespeople independent contractors does not change that.

00:02:33.507 --> 00:02:36.395
Trade names are filed through the prescribed process.

00:02:36.395 --> 00:02:39.643
Misconduct by the entity’s owners or designated producer can

00:02:39.643 --> 00:02:42.530
put the entity’s license at risk as well.

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:45.776
Some people may work around insurance without a

00:02:45.776 --> 00:02:48.617
license, but only within the exception’s conditions.

00:02:48.617 --> 00:02:52.675
A clerical or administrative employee who does not solicit and

00:02:52.675 --> 00:02:56.733
receives no commission is exempt; the moment she urges a

00:02:56.733 --> 00:03:00.385
customer to buy a particular plan, she is soliciting.

00:03:00.385 --> 00:03:05.661
An employer administering its own employee benefit plan without insurer compensation is exempt.

00:03:05.661 --> 00:03:10.124
Insurer officers and employees who do not sell for commission, and

00:03:10.124 --> 00:03:14.588
people who merely refer a customer to a licensed producer without

00:03:14.588 --> 00:03:19.052
discussing coverage, fall under exceptions tied to what they actually do.

00:03:19.052 --> 00:03:23.110
Read the conduct and the compensation, not the job title.

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:28.310
Maryland may issue a temporary license without examination to specified relatives, representatives or

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:33.510
employees of a producer who has died or become disabled, so the business

00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:38.710
can be preserved; the Commissioner must grant or refuse it in writing within

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:43.110
30 days, and it expires 15 months after it takes effect.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:46.310
It is not inherited authority, and the holder

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:49.110
still needs any required appointment before acting.

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:53.910
The rule of thumb for every question in this lesson: identify the

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:58.710
act, sell, solicit or negotiate; identify the person; ask whether the person

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:03.110
holds the license that act requires, or fits a narrow exception.
